h surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol"}}}